# Project Structure

## Component folder (required)

```
Name/
  Name.tsx              # required
  Name.types.ts         # required
  index.ts              # required
  Name.const.ts         # if needed
  Name.utils.ts         # if needed
```

## Library (src/)

- `src/components/{Name}/` — public or view subcomponents
- `src/constants/` — defaults, numbers, generals
- `src/types/` — public and internal types
- `src/utils/` — pure helpers
- `src/hooks/` — `useCalendar` and related hooks
- `src/styles/calendar.css` — shipped as `dist/styles.css`

CSS class prefix: `Cal-` (BEM).

## Labels

Use `library` vs `portal` on Jira/Linear/docs for every task.

## Portal

Companion repo: `calendar-portal` (Bear chrome). Same folder rules for pages/components.

Every folder has an `index.ts` barrel export.
